  m_Name: TheForestAnswers
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: theforestanswers
  displayName: The Forest Answers
  description: 'The forest is gathering against one of your lands. Answer it before it pushes in: stand watch at that land''s stone, or burn the rot''s heart on a raid.'
  chain: The Haven's Reach
  journalNotes: 'The forest doesn''t give land up quietly. It has gathered against the weakest of your lands, and when the warning runs out it will push in and take a good share of the hold.


    Stand watch at that land''s boundary stone: what the forest sends comes for the stone, and if you beat it all without straying the push is broken. Or burn the rot''s heart on a raid: while a push is coming, every raid''s briefing has the rumour of it, and each heart halves the push. Two stop it.


    If it pushes in first, it will gather again before long. Answer the next one.'
